ion"],"evidence_ids":[],"id":"step.cover_allocation","kind":"claim","label":"One index controls every cover tail","locator":"Proof of Theorem 3.1","source_id":"paper.short.pdf","statement":"With allowances $t_j=\\varepsilon2^{-j}$, choose $J$ with $K_J=\\sum_{j>J}C_jt_j^{-\\alpha_j}/(B_j-1)<1/4$ and $L$ divisible by every member of the first $J$ finite sets. For $M\\ge4L$, (S) bounds the $\\mathscr D_{L;R,M}$-mean of $S_J(N)=\\sum_{j>J}t_j^{-\\alpha_j}V_j(N)$ by $(1+4L/M)K_J<1/2$, so some sample satisfies $S_J(N)<1$, hence $U_j(N)<t_j$ for every $j>J$ and $0<\\Delta_{2,A}(N)\\le\\sum_{j>J}U_j(N)\\le\\varepsilon$.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/step.cover_allocation","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/short.thm-variable-fractional-cover","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22short.thm-variable-fractional-cover%22%2C%22step.cover_allocation%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22short.thm-variable-fractional-cover%22%2C%22step.cover_allocation%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/step.cover_allocation"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/step.cover_allocation","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22step.cover_allocation%22%2C%22step.cover_condition%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22step.cover_allocation%22%2C%22step.cover_condition%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argume